Package: module-el6751
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: robotkernel ${misc:Depends}
Description: Robotkernel module for the [Beckhoff EtherCAT Terminal EL6751
  That Terminal enables within an EtherCAT Terminal network the integration of
  any CANopen devices and act as CAN/CANopen master. In addition, general
  CAN messages can be sent or received -- without having to bother with
  CAN frames in the applications program.

